WEBVTT

00:49:54.754 --> 00:50:00.097
And so, the courage to be vulnerable
is one of the key courages of our time.

00:50:00.121 --> 00:50:01.834
I mentioned this group Thread.

00:50:01.858 --> 00:50:03.734
There's a woman who sits on the board.

00:50:03.758 --> 00:50:07.706
Her dad beat her when she was a kid.

00:50:07.730 --> 00:50:10.995
And until she was in Thread,
she didn't tell that story to anybody,

00:50:11.019 --> 00:50:13.974
because it would be vulnerable
and make people uncomfortable.

00:50:13.998 --> 00:50:17.555
But she got in this group
where they have an ethos of, as they say,

00:50:17.579 --> 00:50:20.466
"You will show all the way up.
You will call a thing a thing.

00:50:20.490 --> 00:50:22.632
You will be brutally honest
and vulnerable.

00:50:22.656 --> 00:50:25.680
So she told the story to Thread
and then told it to her family,

00:50:25.704 --> 00:50:28.262
and then she allowed me
to put her writing in my book.

00:50:28.286 --> 00:50:30.548
That's an act of great courage.